        "original_id": "c0e6aba1-53d9-5ab2-ac58-26bc1cb24115",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ian Hunter, Rob Thomas\n- Bands: Mott the Hoople, Matchbox 20\n- Albums: Dirty Laundry\n\nFacts:\n- Ian Hunter Patterson was born on 3 June 1939 and is known professionally as Ian Hunter.\n- Ian Hunter is a British singer-songwriter.\n- Ian Hunter was the lead singer of the English rock band Mott the Hoople from the band's inception in 1969 until its dissolution in 1974.\n- Ian Hunter was also the lead singer of Mott the Hoople during the band's reunions in 2009 and 2013.\n- Robert Kelly Thomas was born on February 14, 1972.\n- Rob Thomas is an American singer, songwriter, record producer, and multi-instrumentalist.\n- Rob Thomas is best known as the lead singer of the alternative band Matchbox 20.\n- Dirty Laundry is the eighth solo album of Ian Hunter.",
